        "description": "<p><a href=\"https://github.com/webguyio/support\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">💬 Ask Question</a> | <a href=\"mailto:webguywork@gmail.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">📧 Email Me</a></p>\n<p>Set your Amazon Affiliate Tracking ID (example-20) for your site just once (under <em>Settings &gt; Amazon Tracking ID</em>) and you&#8217;ll never have to manually create an Amazon affiliate link again. Any time you link to Amazon from now on, regardless of country, it&#8217;ll automatically tag the link with your ID so that you can receive commissions.</p>\n"
